{"id":"en_shadows-of-valeria","title":"Shadows of Valeria","titleEn":"Shadows of Valeria","description":"Rowan, pozornie tylko pozbawiony spadku młody panicz, w rzeczywistości potajemnie rządzi przestępczym światkiem Valerii. Zaraz po pogrzebie jego matki, ojciec Victor sprowadza do domu przebiegłą Elenę wraz z jej synem Leo. Udając łagodną i bezradną, Elena przejmuje rezydencję, którą zmarła matka zapisała Rowanowi. Zamiast od razu ich zabić, Rowan postanawia wciągnąć swoich wrogów prosto do piekła. Losy serialu można śledzić na Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/shadows-of-valeria/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/shadows-of-valeria/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Family Bonds","Karma Payback","Return of the King","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjn7c/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_shadows-of-valeria_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjn7c/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_shadows-of-valeria_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjn7c/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_shadows-of-valeria_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjn7c/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_shadows-of-valeria_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjn7c/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_shadows-of-valeria_5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"number":5,"sources":[{"